OL,3,AThird of young Brits have never had    
OL,4,Asex, but many are sexting and watching 
OL,5,Aporn                                   
OL,7,FHalf of people aged 16 to 24 have sent 
OL,8,For received sexual images on their     
OL,9,Fphone in the last year, while one in   
OL,10,Ftwo young women and almost nine in 10  
OL,11,Fyoung men say they have viewed         
OL,12,Fpornography.                           
OL,14,FBut a third of this age group have     
OL,15,Fnever had sex, up from a fifth in the  
OL,16,Flast study 12 years ago.               
